        {
          "id": "b6e208ca-8fae-3194-84ec-9b7bbcfcf74d",
          "content": {
            "id": "b6e208ca-8fae-3194-84ec-9b7bbcfcf74d",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "How Kraken is trying to rival Oracle, SAP in AI utilities tech",
            "description": "<p>Octopus Energy, a British renewable energy start-up, plans to spin off its artificial intelligence (AI) arm, Kraken Technology, as a standalone entity. Additionally, Kraken may look to go public in the next year, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.wsj.com/articles/octopus-energy-to-spin-off-ai-arm-kraken-to-create-potential-15-billion-software-platform-281d9a8c\">according to the Wall Street Journal</a>.</p>\n<p>Kraken CEO Amir Orad joins Market Catalysts with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?fr=sycsrp_catchall\">Julie Hyman</a> to discuss the de-merger, AI energy demand, and how Kraken compares to other names in the space, such as Oracle (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/ORCL\">ORCL</a>) and SAP (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/SAP\">SAP</a>).</p>\n<p>To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more <a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-catalysts/\">Market Catalysts</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Octopus Energy, a British renewable energy start-up, plans to spin off its artificial intelligence (AI) arm, Kraken Technology, as a standalone entity. Additionally, Kraken may look to go public in the next year, according to the Wall Street Journal. Kraken CEO Amir Orad joins Market Catalysts with Julie Hyman to discuss the de-merger, AI energy demand, and how Kraken compares to other names in the space, such as Oracle (ORCL) and SAP (SAP). To watch more expert insights and analysis on the latest market action, check out more Market Catalysts.",
